<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets 250 bln lire 2-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets 250 bln lire 2-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Credito Italiano and Morgan Stanley International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MORGAN STANLEY INTERNATIONAL</p>
<p> AMT    250 BLN ITL   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    30.APR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +5 BP     PAY DATE    30 APR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.95     FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    99.95</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
